"StringEquals": {
"kms:ViaService": "es.us-west-1.amazonaws.com"
},
"Bool": {
"kms:GrantIsForAWSResource": "true"
}
}
For more information, see Key policies in AWS KMS in the AWS Key Management Service Developer
Guide.
